<p>After looking back at the old discussion to figure out what the hell you were talking about&#8230;</p>
<p>No, I didn't give any thought to what you said because I never read your comment on the old page. This has been in the works for literally over a year. Task forces &quot;piling up&quot; was never an issue and this streamlining of the remaining entries was so that this page could actually serve as an example of what MTFs were supposed to do.</p>
