			<div class="content" id="post-content-1933234">
									

<p>I love this page. I love this page especially because I tried to write the original overhaul draft&#8230;</p>
<p>&#8230;and it was hard as <em>hell</em>. The only Task Forces with decent descriptions were Omega-7 and the Silencers. And the vast majority of them were <em>boring</em>, boring as all hell.</p>
<p>And now, after a lot of hard work from Aelanna and consultants&#8230; there are a bunch of really fun ones, and the holdovers have improved descriptions.</p>
<p>I pretty much love the additions; O5 Command's personal inquistion force (Red Right Hand), a legit MTF of wizards and witches (Bookworms), a long-omitted religious phenomena MTF (Exorcists)&#8230; Yeah, I'm pretty happy with this. This is a LOT of new story fodder right here.</p>
<p>And the writing guide actually gives people guidance on how to write MTFs! Something which never existed before.</p>
<p>Also, the labels are friggin' gorgeous. Just sayin'.</p>

							</div>

								
